// REJECTS: Field 'content' is required
//
// A schema entry may carry id and location and MUST carry content. All three are optional
// and repeatable as far as the .g4 is concerned -- `schema: { (schemaId|schemaLocation|schemaContent)* }`.
//
// `content` is the field that actually holds the schema; a set of schemas with locations and
// no content is a plausible-looking placeholder that only the walker refuses.
###ExternalFormat
SchemaSet fixture::neg::SchemaWithoutContent
{
   format: FlatData;
   schemas: [
      {
         id: primary;
         location: 'people.schema';
      }
   ];
}
